 "name": "Blood Crystallization",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/blood-manipulation.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Blood Constructs</em></p>\n<p>You gain the ability to harden your blood to a solid, even if it risks thrombosis and further increases your versatility. As a bonus action for 3 CE. you gain the following for 1 minute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>As a reaction, you can add a +5 to your AC against an attack.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your unarmed damage dice increases by two levels (d8&lt;d10&lt;d12&lt;2d8)  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At the end of your turn, roll a d20. On a 2 or lower you gain a level of exhaustion.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
